Dictation (src/shell/plugins/dictation) downloads, at its first use and not with Nova,
NVIDIA's Parakeet TDT 0.6B v3 speech model (https://huggingface.co/nvidia/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3),
licensed under CC-BY-4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/), in the
conversion ggml-org made of it for whisper.cpp (https://huggingface.co/ggml-org/parakeet-GGUF).
Nova does not redistribute it.

The [nova] package repository also carries two programs built from their release tags,
each with its licence and notice in its package: whisper.cpp
(https://github.com/ggml-org/whisper.cpp, MIT, with the copy of ggml, MIT, that the
release carries), unmodified, by packaging/whisper-cpp; and Hyprland
(https://github.com/hyprwm/Hyprland, BSD-3-Clause), with Nova's patches
packaging/hyprland/xwayland-scale.patch, release-bind.patch,
xwayland-emulated-modes.patch and xwayland-relative-motion.patch, by
packaging/hyprland.
